{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e13f5ccb08a3b8a9530cea4b6afed7b8051a928ad3ea5e17c91f759016a1c190", "ja": "あれ、育？　どうしたんだ、こんなところで。\n今日はオフだったよな？", "zh": "咦，育？怎么了，怎么会在这种地方？\n今天不是休息日吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "bc9e5a592d601b0a03a9b8bf0ee216d6ff7f245a1609aa51b830ae7c819e2d45", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　今日はね、\n桃子ちゃんと環ちゃんと、約束があるの。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！今天呢，\n我和桃子、环约好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3668372f6488264c0e10152d62ec7b50f3b4ce6db80c4c6c345ce4a79ad6958f", "ja": "そうだったんだな。\n3人で遊ぶのか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。要和3个人一起玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "fe5ff3c059fdb1ec05f7cbbf8e7c2543c0e180868458790b08b12869c665d194", "ja": "うん、遊ぶ約束もしてるけど。\nその前に、冬休みの宿題をするんだよ！", "zh": "嗯，虽然也约好了要一起玩。\n但在那之前，要先做寒假作业哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "15988409b9deece49caa914660ac86143a7ba16facaf76eee1e769a1df3c3009", "ja": "ふたりもまだ終わってないんだって。だから、\nみんなでやって、一気に終わらせちゃおうと思って。", "zh": "听说她们俩也还没做完。所以，我想大家一起做，一口气把作业都完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1005_p", "source_sha256": "53506c60a632821ab71340082768a232a931a4be4ffeb27dc068ec328ce4b63b", "ja": "おお、えらいな。\nみんなで協力すれば、あっという間だな。", "zh": "哦，真能干啊。大家一起合作的话，很快就能完成了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "d7a3010c2e69f9cb52614b6bd348980c599eb27384dfae3fecd134e2590874c2", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　{$P$}さんも\nわたしたちといっしょに、お仕事する？", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生也要和我们一起工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "63d72aebe97021fbbbbb161d9c427d9f3bcefe5a1990b83eca24bdb7930409b2", "ja": "ひとりでやるよりも、たくさんがんばれて、\nいつもより早くお仕事が終わるかも！", "zh": "比起一个人做，大家一起努力的话，说不定能比平时更早结束工作呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1008_p", "source_sha256": "be8cae90ea8e092aca05eeabaf0c8f37557d921b34776042f3bbd9e52ac31b45", "ja": "そうだな……。\nちょうど気分を変えたいと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "是啊……我正好也想换换心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "d935acfa05d32e300c49aec8c0c2ef2109194f71459982bdff6bfd3ab6e7edc1", "ja": "でしょ♪　それに{$P$}さんが\nいてくれたら、わからないところも聞けるし……。", "zh": "对吧♪ 而且要是有{$P$}先生在的话，不懂的地方也能请教……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "f91b9c474c356570e82f50c60a2477b6094060d75838c7230ffe1511fb93ac48", "ja": "{$P$}さんのお仕事が早く終わったら\nわたしたちといっしょに遊べるね♪", "zh": "要是{$P$}先生的工作能早点结束，\n就能和我们一起玩了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4f081382b4fe6a80736464afd1ae83cbcda91dfdaff9f1f8ce364edad3a956fa", "ja": "いいのか？\n3人で遊ぶ約束だったんだろう？", "zh": "这样真的好吗？\n不是约好了要和3个人一起玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "45293b6faa43e9f9d169da98485e42c0374f527c09ed210ab4c7aeb6cac04a31", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。{$P$}さんがいたら\nふたりも喜ぶと思うよ。それに人数もぴったり！", "zh": "没事的。要是{$P$}先生也在，\n她们两个肯定也会很高兴的。而且人数也正合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1013_p", "source_sha256": "39c7410246feca550282d2282a7e5187af94b78d7972538c6d4e0b7db4261158", "ja": "人数？", "zh": "人数？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "dd01b365cbd95ec1140004cab12f94771efa8fdbbd0e3db9c59f304991e57b4c", "ja": "うん。羽根つきで遊ぶつもりなの。みんなの顔、\nスミで真っ黒にしちゃうからね。えへへ♪", "zh": "嗯。打算玩板羽球。我可是会用\n墨汁把大家的脸都涂得漆黑哦。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0543_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b625dec2b20a90887e092d211229fc3ad40f41a74588dd12867207a31cf4196e", "ja": "（育たちとやることを終わらせた後、羽根つきをした。\n結果は全敗……。俺だけ顔が真っ黒になった……）", "zh": "（和育她们结束了要做的事之后，玩了打羽毛球板游戏。\n结果全输了……只有我的脸被涂得乌漆嘛黑的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
